e + N2(X) -> e + N2(aprime_1Sigma_u-). Su et al. J. Phys. B 54, 115203 (2021) (CC BY 4.0) below 20 eV; Johnson et al. J. Geophys. Res. 110, A11311 (2005) Table 2 from 20 eV; power-law continuation p = 1.67 above Johnson's last point (to 10 keV). Overlap Su/Johnson: 12.5 eV 1.51 (+-0.23), 15 eV 0.75 (+-0.28), 17.5 eV 1.17 (+-0.24), 20 eV 1.51 (+-0.27); step at 20 eV Su/Johnson = 1.51. Continuation share of the rate: T_e 20 eV 0.5 % (zero/hold tail -0.5/+0.2 %), T_e 30 eV 2.4 % (zero/hold tail -2.4/+1.2 %). Header 9.92 eV = experimental vertical excitation energy (Oddershede, Su 2021 Table 1); no threshold shift. Maxwellian-integrated by abep_sim/rate_tables.py (scripts/build_n2_electronic_excitation_tables.py). Reaction set abep-n2n-0.9.
